# Normalize line endings: LF inside the repository, native in the working tree.
# Without this, saving a file on Windows (CRLF) makes dozens of files look modified
# in this repository and in the parent AzzyAI checkout.
* text=auto

# Binary assets: never convert, never diff as text
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.bmp binary
*.webp binary
